  <exercise data-content-id="ddb461ca-54ff-4d3a-938d-267147fd2d73" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="Up" data-solution-options="[&quot;Up&quot;, &quot;Down&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para> For the function \(f(x)=(x-4)^2-5\), does the graph open up or down? </para>
      </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! The graph opens upward. The squared term has a positive coefficient (1). </para>
    </solution>
